1. Jenkins CI/CD Pipeline (Remember: CBSTAD)

C → B → S → T → A → D

C – Checkout (GitLab)
B – Build (Maven)
S – Scan (SonarQube + Trivy)
T – Test (JUnit)
A – Artifact (Nexus + ECR)
D – Deploy (Helm → EKS)

One-line answer:

"Developer commits code → Jenkins triggers → Checkout → Build → SonarQube → Unit Test → Store Artifact → Docker Build → Trivy Scan → Push to ECR → Deploy to EKS using Helm."

